<title>JAPAN: Foreigners net buyers of Japanese stocks in week.</title>
<headline>Foreigners net buyers of Japanese stocks in week.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Foreigners were net buyers of Japanese stocks on the Tokyo, Osaka and Nagoya stock exchanges in the week of March 3 to March 7, exchange data showed.</p>
<p>The figures, which are rounded, are as follows:</p>
<p> Total foreign buying	   533.16 billion yen</p>
<p> Total foreign selling	  453.54 billion yen</p>
<p> Net buying			  79.62 billion yen</p>
<p> Previous week net buying	89.84 billion yen</p>
